      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Waking up in Vika's bed the next morning, Max happily assumes that their night together means she has forgiven him and even suggests they fly away together as a couple. However, Vika quickly cools his enthusiasm, calling herself a fool for giving in to her emotions and reminding him that he cheated on her.",
      "gap": 0.8
